{"page":33,"verses":[{"verse_key":"2:211","surah":2,"ayah":211,"ar_uthmani":"سَلْ بَنِىٓ إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ كَمْ ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُم مِّنْ ءَايَةٍۭ بَيِّنَةٍ ۗ وَمَن يُبَدِّلْ نِعْمَةَ ٱللَّهِ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَتْهُ فَإِنَّ ٱللَّهَ شَدِيدُ ٱلْعِقَابِ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"[Prophet], ask the Children of Israel how many clear signs We brought them. If anyone alters God’s blessings after he has received them, God is stern in punishment.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"سَلْ","en_gloss":"Ask","transliteration":"sal","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":2,"ar":"بَنِىٓ","en_gloss":"(the) Children","transliteration":"banī","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":3,"ar":"إِسْرَٰٓءِيلَ","en_gloss":"(of) Israel","transliteration":"is'rāīla","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":4,"ar":"كَمْ","en_gloss":"how many","transliteration":"kam","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ءَاتَيْنَـٰهُم","en_gloss":"We gave them","transliteration":"ātaynāhum","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":6,"ar":"مِّنْ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ءَايَةٍۭ","en_gloss":"(the) Sign(s)","transliteration":"āyatin","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":8,"ar":"بَيِّنَةٍۢ ۗ","en_gloss":"clear","transliteration":"bayyinatin","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمَن","en_gloss":"And whoever","transliteration":"waman","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":10,"ar":"يُبَدِّلْ","en_gloss":"changes","transliteration":"yubaddil","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":11,"ar":"نِعْمَةَ","en_gloss":"Favor","transliteration":"niʿ'mata","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱللَّهِ","en_gloss":"(of) Allah","transliteration":"l-lahi","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":13,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":14,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":15,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"[what]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":16,"ar":"جَآءَتْهُ","en_gloss":"it (has) come to him ","transliteration":"jāathu","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فَإِنَّ","en_gloss":"then indeed","transliteration":"fa-inna","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱللَّهَ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-laha","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":19,"ar":"شَدِيدُ","en_gloss":"(is) severe","transliteration":"shadīdu","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":20,"ar":"ٱلْعِقَابِ","en_gloss":"in [the] chastising","transliteration":"l-ʿiqābi","verse_key":"2:211"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٢١١","en_gloss":"(211)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:211"}]},{"verse_key":"2:212","surah":2,"ayah":212,"ar_uthmani":"زُيِّنَ لِلَّذِينَ كَفَرُوا۟ ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَيَسْخَرُونَ مِنَ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ ۘ وَٱلَّذِينَ ٱتَّقَوْا۟ فَوْقَهُمْ يَوْمَ ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَرْزُقُ مَن يَشَآءُ بِغَيْرِ حِسَابٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The life of this world is made to seem glamorous to the disbelievers, and they laugh at those who believe. But those who are mindful of God will be above them on the Day of Resurrection: God provides immeasurably for whoever He pleases.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"زُيِّنَ","en_gloss":"Beautified","transliteration":"zuyyina","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":2,"ar":"لِلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"for those who","transliteration":"lilladhīna","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":3,"ar":"كَفَرُوا۟","en_gloss":"disbelieve[d]","transliteration":"kafarū","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":4,"ar":"ٱلْحَيَوٰةُ","en_gloss":"(is) the life","transliteration":"l-ḥayatu","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":5,"ar":"ٱلدُّنْيَا","en_gloss":"(of) the world","transliteration":"l-dun'yā","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":6,"ar":"وَيَسْخَرُونَ","en_gloss":"and they ridicule","transliteration":"wayaskharūna","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":7,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"[of]","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":8,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":9,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟ ۘ","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"And those who","transliteration":"wa-alladhīna","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":11,"ar":"ٱتَّقَوْا۟","en_gloss":"fear (Allah)","transliteration":"ittaqaw","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":12,"ar":"فَوْقَهُمْ","en_gloss":"(they will be) above them","transliteration":"fawqahum","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَوْمَ","en_gloss":"(on the) Day","transliteration":"yawma","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":14,"ar":"ٱلْقِيَـٰمَةِ ۗ","en_gloss":"(of) Resurrection","transliteration":"l-qiyāmati","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":15,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":16,"ar":"يَرْزُقُ","en_gloss":"provides","transliteration":"yarzuqu","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":17,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":18,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":19,"ar":"بِغَيْرِ","en_gloss":"without","transliteration":"bighayri","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":20,"ar":"حِسَابٍۢ","en_gloss":"measure","transliteration":"ḥisābin","verse_key":"2:212"},{"pos":21,"ar":"٢١٢","en_gloss":"(212)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:212"}]},{"verse_key":"2:213","surah":2,"ayah":213,"ar_uthmani":"كَانَ ٱلنَّاسُ أُمَّةً وَٰحِدَةً فَبَعَثَ ٱللَّهُ ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ مُبَشِّرِينَ وَمُنذِرِينَ وَأَنزَلَ مَعَهُمُ ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ بِٱلْحَقِّ لِيَحْكُمَ بَيْنَ ٱلنَّاسِ فِيمَا ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟ فِيهِ ۚ وَمَا ٱخْتَلَفَ فِيهِ إِلَّا ٱلَّذِينَ أُوتُوهُ مِنۢ بَعْدِ مَا جَآءَتْهُمُ ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ بَغْيًۢا بَيْنَهُمْ ۖ فَهَدَى ٱللَّهُ ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ لِمَا ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟ فِيهِ مِنَ ٱلْحَقِّ بِإِذْنِهِۦ ۗ وَٱللَّهُ يَهْدِى مَن يَشَآءُ إِلَىٰ صِرَٰطٍ مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Mankind was a single community, then God sent prophets to bring good news and warning, and with them He sent the Scripture with the Truth, to judge between people in their disagreements. It was only those to whom it was given who disagreed about it after clear signs had come to them, because of rivalry between them. So by His leave God guided the believers to the truth they had differed about: God guides whoever He will to a straight path.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"Was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":2,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسُ","en_gloss":"mankind","transliteration":"l-nāsu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أُمَّةًۭ","en_gloss":"a community","transliteration":"ummatan","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":4,"ar":"وَٰحِدَةًۭ","en_gloss":"single","transliteration":"wāḥidatan","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":5,"ar":"فَبَعَثَ","en_gloss":"then raised up","transliteration":"fabaʿatha","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":6,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":7,"ar":"ٱلنَّبِيِّـۧنَ","en_gloss":"[the] Prophets","transliteration":"l-nabiyīna","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":8,"ar":"مُبَشِّرِينَ","en_gloss":"(as) bearers of glad tidings","transliteration":"mubashirīna","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":9,"ar":"وَمُنذِرِينَ","en_gloss":"and (as) warners","transliteration":"wamundhirīna","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":10,"ar":"وَأَنزَلَ","en_gloss":"and sent down","transliteration":"wa-anzala","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":11,"ar":"مَعَهُمُ","en_gloss":"with them","transliteration":"maʿahumu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":12,"ar":"ٱلْكِتَـٰبَ","en_gloss":"the Book","transliteration":"l-kitāba","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":13,"ar":"بِٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"in [the] truth","transliteration":"bil-ḥaqi","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":14,"ar":"لِيَحْكُمَ","en_gloss":"to judge","transliteration":"liyaḥkuma","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":15,"ar":"بَيْنَ","en_gloss":"between","transliteration":"bayna","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":16,"ar":"ٱلنَّاسِ","en_gloss":"[the] people","transliteration":"l-nāsi","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":17,"ar":"فِيمَا","en_gloss":"in what","transliteration":"fīmā","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":18,"ar":"ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","en_gloss":"they differed","transliteration":"ikh'talafū","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":19,"ar":"فِيهِ ۚ","en_gloss":"[in it]","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":20,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And (did) not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":21,"ar":"ٱخْتَلَفَ","en_gloss":"differ[ed]","transliteration":"ikh'talafa","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":22,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"in it","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":23,"ar":"إِلَّا","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":24,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":25,"ar":"أُوتُوهُ","en_gloss":"were given it","transliteration":"ūtūhu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":26,"ar":"مِنۢ","en_gloss":"from","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":27,"ar":"بَعْدِ","en_gloss":"after","transliteration":"baʿdi","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":28,"ar":"مَا","en_gloss":"[what]","transliteration":"mā","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":29,"ar":"جَآءَتْهُمُ","en_gloss":"came to them","transliteration":"jāathumu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":30,"ar":"ٱلْبَيِّنَـٰتُ","en_gloss":"the clear proofs","transliteration":"l-bayinātu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":31,"ar":"بَغْيًۢا","en_gloss":"(out of) jealousy","transliteration":"baghyan","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":32,"ar":"بَيْنَهُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"among themselves","transliteration":"baynahum","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":33,"ar":"فَهَدَى","en_gloss":"And guided","transliteration":"fahadā","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":34,"ar":"ٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"Allah","transliteration":"l-lahu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":35,"ar":"ٱلَّذِينَ","en_gloss":"those who","transliteration":"alladhīna","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":36,"ar":"ءَامَنُوا۟","en_gloss":"believe[d]","transliteration":"āmanū","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":37,"ar":"لِمَا","en_gloss":"regarding what","transliteration":"limā","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":38,"ar":"ٱخْتَلَفُوا۟","en_gloss":"they differed","transliteration":"ikh'talafū","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":39,"ar":"فِيهِ","en_gloss":"[in it]","transliteration":"fīhi","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":40,"ar":"مِنَ","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"mina","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":41,"ar":"ٱلْحَقِّ","en_gloss":"the Truth","transliteration":"l-ḥaqi","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":42,"ar":"بِإِذْنِهِۦ ۗ","en_gloss":"with His permission","transliteration":"bi-idh'nihi","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":43,"ar":"وَٱللَّهُ","en_gloss":"And Allah","transliteration":"wal-lahu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":44,"ar":"يَهْدِى","en_gloss":"guides","transliteration":"yahdī","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":45,"ar":"مَن","en_gloss":"whom","transliteration":"man","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":46,"ar":"يَشَآءُ","en_gloss":"He wills","transliteration":"yashāu","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":47,"ar":"إِلَىٰ","en_gloss":"to","transliteration":"ilā","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":48,"ar":"صِرَٰطٍۢ","en_gloss":"a path","transliteration":"ṣirāṭin","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":49,"ar":"مُّسْتَقِيمٍ","en_gloss":"straight","transliteration":"mus'taqīmin","verse_key":"2:213"},{"pos":50,"ar":"٢١٣","en_gloss":"(213)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"2:213"}]},{"verse_key":"2:214","surah":2,"ayah":214,"ar_uthmani":"أَمْ حَسِبْتُمْ أَن تَدْخُلُوا۟ ٱلْجَنَّةَ وَلَمَّا يَأْتِكُم مَّثَلُ ٱلَّذِينَ خَلَوْا۟ مِن قَبْلِكُم ۖ مَّسَّتْهُمُ ٱلْبَأْسَآءُ وَٱلضَّرَّآءُ وَزُلْزِلُوا۟ حَتَّىٰ يَقُولَ ٱلرَّسُولُ وَٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوا۟ مَعَهُۥ مَتَىٰ نَصْرُ ٱللَّهِ ۗ أَلَآ إِنَّ نَصْرَ ٱللَّهِ قَرِيبٌ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"Do you suppose that you will enter the Garden without first having suffered like those before you? They were afflicted by misfortune and hardship, and they were so shaken that even [their] messenger and the believers with him cried, ‘When will God’s help arrive?’ Truly, God’s help is near.","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"أَمْ","en_gloss":"Or","transliteration":"am","verse_key":"2:214"},{"pos":2,"ar":"حَسِبْتُمْ","en_gloss":"(do) you think","transliteration":"ḥasib'tum","verse_key":"2:214"},{"pos":3,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"2:214"},{"pos":4,"ar":"تَدْخُلُوا۟","en_gloss":"you will enter","transl